# Third-party data notice

This repository contains software developed for the GC–EI Annotation Reliability Tool.

The original public EI/Kovats-RI spectral library used in the associated study is not redistributed in this repository.

Source dataset:

Tsugawa H. `msdial_eimslib_kovatsri`. Zenodo. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21910638.

The publication file used by the workflow is `GCMS DB-Public-KovatsRI-VS3.msp`.

The tool obtains the source from the original Zenodo record or accepts a user-provided exact local copy, verifies the expected SHA-256 hash, and constructs transient local reference assets.

